{"id": 1497, "title": "My Birthday", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK1"], "slug": "my-birthday", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/1497_my-birthday.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我在一九九二年二月二十九日出生，那一天是我的生日。我不喜欢这一天，因为这一天很不一样。一九九二年有三百六十六天，不是三百六十五天，多的那一天是二月的二十九日。这一年也叫“闰年”。你知道吗？你们每一年都可以过生日，我每四年才能过生日。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我在一九九二年二月二十九日出生，那一天是我的生日。我不喜歡這一天，因為這一天很不一樣。一九九二年有三百六十六天，不是三百六十五天，多的那一天是二月的二十九日。這一年也叫“閏年”。你知道嗎？你們每一年都可以過生日，我每四年才能過生日。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ zài yī jiǔ jiǔ èr nián Èr yuè èr shí jiǔ rì chū shēng， nà yī tiān shì wǒ de shēng rì。 wǒ bù xǐ huan zhè yī tiān， yīn wèi zhè yī tiān hěn bù yī yàng。 yī jiǔ jiǔ èr nián yǒu sān bǎi liù shí liù tiān， bù shì sān bǎi liù shí wǔ tiān， duō de nà yī tiān shì Èr yuè de èr shí jiǔ rì。 zhè yī nián yě jiào“ rùn nián”。 nǐ zhī dào ma？ nǐ men měi yī nián dōu kě yǐ guò shēng rì， wǒ měi sì nián cái néng guò shēng rì。"], "english_paragraphs": ["I was born on February 29, 1992, so that’s my birthday. I don’t like this date because it’s so unusual. There were 366 days in 1992, not 365. The extra day was February 29. A year like that is called a “leap year.” Did you know that? You can celebrate your birthday every year, but I can only celebrate mine once every four years."], "english_full": "I was born on February 29, 1992, so that’s my birthday. I don’t like this date because it’s so unusual. There were 366 days in 1992, not 365. The extra day was February 29. A year like that is called a “leap year.” Did you know that? You can celebrate your birthday every year, but I can only celebrate mine once every four years.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zài\" data-defn=\"(of sb or sth) to be (located) at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data